/* SleepControl interface, help and diagnostics. */
"%@ minutes" = "%@ 分钟";
". Only the last confirmed task status is available. Check the connection to your AI app." = "。当前仅保留最后确认的状态，请检查客户端连接。";
"1 hour" = "1 小时";
"1 minute" = "1 分钟";
"A Codex session reported an unknown or unexpected status." = "Codex 会话出现未知或异常状态。";
"A hook may be called Unnamed hook. That is normal. Look for the helper filename and marker below in its command to identify the SleepControl hook." = "钩子的名字可能是 Unnamed hook，这是正常的。检查命令里是否有下面的文件名和标识，就能认出 SleepControl 的钩子。";
"A subtask started by the AI, or a command running in the background, has not finished." = "AI 启动的子任务，或放到后台运行的命令，还没有结束。";
"AI sleep protection" = "AI休眠保护状态";
"AI sleep protection error: %@" = "AI保护异常：%@";
"AI status is being updated. Please try again shortly." = "AI 状态正在更新，请稍后重试。";
"After all tasks stop, SleepControl waits about two seconds, then checks the power source, lid position, and switch settings. If the lid is closed and your settings allow sleep, it puts your Mac to sleep. If the lid is open, it restores your usual settings and lets macOS decide when to sleep automatically." = "所有任务都停下来后，SleepControl 会等约两秒，再检查当前的电源、合盖情况和开关设置。如果已经合盖，而且按设置应该休眠，就让电脑休眠；如果还开着盖，就恢复原来的设置，由 macOS 决定何时自动休眠。";
"Authorization was cancelled." = "已取消授权。";
"Battery %@%%" = "电量 %@%%";
"Charging" = "充电中";
"Check that the hook comes from your user configuration and its command contains the filename and marker above, then trust it. Check all %@ events below, not just SessionStart:" = "确认钩子来自用户配置，而且命令里有上面的文件名和标识，再选择信任。下面这 %@ 个事件都要检查，不能只设 SessionStart：";
"Check whether hooks have been disabled" = "检查钩子是否被关闭了";
"Checking whether your Mac can sleep…" = "正在复核休眠条件…";
"Choose a task that runs on this Mac and takes a little time. Watch the status at the bottom of this window. If your usual settings allow sleep, Claude should appear while the task runs. The status should change when the task finishes or pauses for your input. Seeing the configuration in /hooks alone does not confirm that SleepControl is receiving task status." = "选一个在这台 Mac 上运行、需要花一点时间的任务，观察本窗口底部的状态。电脑原本允许休眠时，任务执行期间应能看到 Claude；任务结束或停下来等你操作后，状态也应随之变化。只在 /hooks 中看到配置，还不能说明 SleepControl 已经收到了任务状态。";
"Choose a task that runs on this Mac and takes a little time. Watch the status at the bottom of this window. If your usual settings allow sleep, Codex should appear while the task runs. The status should change when the task finishes or pauses for your input." = "选一个在这台 Mac 上运行、需要花一点时间的任务，观察本窗口底部的状态。电脑原本允许休眠时，任务执行期间应能看到 Codex；任务结束或停下来等你操作后，状态也应随之变化。";
"Claude Code hook documentation ↗" = "查看 Claude Code 官方钩子说明 ↗";
"Claude Code setup" = "Claude Code 配置";
"Claude Code usually picks up configuration changes automatically. If the hooks are still missing or tasks are not detected, reopen the local conversation and try again." = "Claude Code 通常会自动读取配置的修改。如果还是看不到钩子，或者检测不到任务，重新打开本机会话再试。";
"Claude returned an unknown task status: %@" = "Claude 返回未识别的任务状态：%@";
"Close" = "关闭";
"Cloud tasks, tasks running on a remote computer over SSH, regular Claude chats, and Cowork are not guaranteed to be detected." = "云端任务、通过 SSH 在远程电脑上运行的任务、普通 Claude 聊天和 Cowork，目前不能保证识别。";
"Codex WebSocket returned an invalid or oversized message." = "Codex WebSocket 返回无效或过大的消息。";
"Codex and Claude Code on Mac computers are supported. Tasks in their desktop apps also need to run locally and report their status to SleepControl. Follow the setup steps in the other two tabs, then run a task to check that it is detected." = "支持Mac 电脑上的 Codex 和 Claude Code。桌面版中的任务，也需要在本机执行，并且能把任务状态传给 SleepControl。请按后两页的步骤配置，再运行一次任务，确认能检测到。";
"Codex closed the local status connection." = "Codex 已关闭本地状态连接。";
"Codex hook documentation ↗" = "查看 Codex 官方钩子说明 ↗";
"Codex setup" = "Codex 配置";
"Codex status method %@ returned an error (%@)." = "Codex 状态接口 %@ 返回错误（%@）。";
"Codex status method %@ returned no result." = "Codex 状态接口 %@ 缺少结果。";
"Command ends with: # %@" = "命令末尾：# %@";
"Copy hook marker" = "复制钩子标识";
"Desktop app and common questions" = "桌面版和其他常见情况";
"Desktop app and custom configuration folders" = "桌面版和自定义配置目录";
"Display sleep" = "锁屏";
"Enter /hooks in Claude Code" = "在 Claude Code 中输入 /hooks";
"Enter /hooks in the Codex CLI" = "在 Codex 命令行中输入 /hooks";
"Find the hooks from your user settings, open their command details, and look for the filename and marker below. In Claude Code, /hooks lets you view the configuration. You do not need to trust each hook as you do in Codex." = "找到来自用户设置的钩子，打开命令详情，检查是否有下面的文件名和标识。Claude Code 的 /hooks 用来查看配置，不需要像 Codex 那样逐个设置信任。";
"For Code tasks in the desktop app that use the local Claude Code engine, follow the same steps to check the setup. Regular Claude chats, Cowork, cloud tasks, and remote SSH tasks are not guaranteed to be detected." = "桌面版中使用本机 Claude Code 运行的 Code 任务，也可以按上面的步骤检查。普通 Claude 聊天、Cowork、云端和 SSH 远程任务，目前不能保证识别。";
"Fully charged" = "已充满";
"Help category" = "说明分类";
"Help with staying awake during AI tasks" = "AI任务执行时不休眠说明";
"Helper file: %@" = "助手文件：%@";
"How it works" = "功能说明";
"If task status cannot be read for a while, SleepControl does not assume the tasks have finished. Any sleep protection already in place is kept until the connection recovers or you turn the AI switch off." = "如果暂时读不到任务状态，SleepControl 不会把它当成任务已经结束。为任务开启的不休眠保护会先保留，直到恢复连接，或你关闭 AI 开关。";
"If the first two switches already keep your Mac awake, the AI switch has nothing extra to do. When both switches are on, the AI switch is hidden. Turn either one off to show it again; your previous choice is kept." = "如果前两个开关的设置已经让电脑不休眠，AI 开关就不需要起作用。两个开关都打开时，AI 开关会隐藏；关掉其中一个，就会重新显示，之前的选择也会保留。";
"If the hooks are missing from /hooks, quit Codex completely and reopen it, then check again. Entering /clear does not mean the hook configuration has been reloaded." = "如果 /hooks 里找不到钩子，彻底退出 Codex 后重新打开，再检查一次。输入 /clear 并不代表钩子配置已经重新加载。";
"If you changed CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, make sure SleepControl and Claude Code use the same configuration directory. If “status unknown” appears after updating Claude Code, check that the hooks are still present and enabled. SleepControl may also need an update to support the new version." = "如果改过 CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR，要让 SleepControl 和 Claude Code 使用同一个配置目录。如果更新 Claude Code 后出现“状态未知”，先检查钩子是否还在、是否被禁用；也可能需要更新 SleepControl，才能适配新版本。";
"If you changed CODEX_HOME, make sure SleepControl and Codex use the same configuration directory. Conversations that are not connected to the local Codex service may not reliably distinguish running tasks from requests for your approval." = "如果改过 CODEX_HOME，要让 SleepControl 和 Codex 使用同一个配置目录。如果对话没有连上 Codex 的本机服务，可能无法准确判断它是在执行任务，还是在等你批准操作。";
"If you have several conversations open, all their tasks need to stop first. Your Mac stays awake while any background task is still running, even if a conversation is waiting for you." = "如果同时开了几个对话，要等所有任务都停下来才行。即使某个对话正在等你操作，只要还有后台任务没做完，电脑就会继续保持不休眠。";
"If your configuration includes disableAllHooks, make sure it is not true. Setting it to true disables all hooks, so SleepControl cannot receive task status. Set it to false or leave it unset to allow hooks. Project settings, administrator settings, and launch options can also disable hooks." = "如果配置里有 disableAllHooks，确认它没有设成 true。设成 true 会禁用所有钩子，SleepControl 也就收不到任务状态；设成 false，或不设置这一项，才允许钩子运行。项目配置、管理员设置和启动选项也可能禁用钩子。";
"In the desktop app, choose a project or Worktree task that runs on this computer and uses the same user configuration. Run a task to check that SleepControl recognizes both active work and pauses for your input." = "使用桌面版时，选择在这台电脑执行的项目或 Worktree 任务，并使用同一份用户配置。最好实际跑一次任务，确认执行和等待你操作时，SleepControl 都能正确识别。";
