"SleepControl could not restore your sleep settings and has not quit: %@" = "恢复原有休眠设置失败，未退出：%@";
"SleepControl installs its helper and adds the hooks needed to receive task status to ~/.codex/hooks.json. Your other settings are kept, so you do not need to edit the file yourself. The first time you change power settings, you may need to enter an administrator password." = "SleepControl 会自动安装助手，并在 ~/.codex/hooks.json 中添加接收任务状态所需的钩子（hooks），已有的其他配置会保留，不用手动编辑文件。第一次修改电源设置时，可能需要输入一次管理员密码。";
